[ti:Learning How to Stay]
[00:15.52][Verse]
[00:15.60]My phone lights up before the morning does
[00:21.36]New words arrive with names I never learned
[00:27.04]The train doors close on another version
[00:32.60]Of the city while my coffee burns
[00:39.12]I keep a map of streets that disappear
[00:44.92]In the back pocket of my coat
[00:50.60]Every headline changes shape at midnight
[00:54.20]Every promise learns to float
[00:57.68][Pre-Chorus]
[00:57.76]I run toward the skyline
[01:03.48]It moves when I get close
[01:09.12]I reach for solid ground
[01:12.52]And find another coast
[01:15.24][Chorus]
[01:15.32]I’m still learning how to stay
[01:19.52]While the world rewrites its name
[01:25.28]Every door becomes a window
[01:28.12]Every fire becomes a flame
[01:30.96]If I’m late to every future
[01:33.84]Let me be late my own way
[01:37.08]I’m still learning how to stay
[01:50.52][Verse]
[01:50.60]The kids downstairs speak in borrowed signals
[01:55.96]Laughing in a language made last week
[02:02.04]I watch their shadows cross the lobby glass
[02:05.60]And practice being small enough to breathe
[02:08.64]There’s a box of wires beneath my bed
[02:11.32]Old chargers curled like sleeping snakes
[02:14.16]I keep them like a record of the people
[02:20.24]I was before the updates changed
[02:25.88][Pre-Chorus]
[02:25.96]Maybe I was never meant
[02:31.52]To catch each passing train
[02:36.68]Maybe keeping one warm room
[02:40.60]Is not the same as staying
[02:43.80][Chorus]
[02:43.88]I’m still learning how to stay
[02:48.12]While the world rewrites its name
[02:53.84]Every door becomes a window
[02:56.68]Every fire becomes a flame
[02:59.56]If I’m late to every future
[03:02.40]Let me be late my own way
[03:05.64]I’m still learning how to stay
[03:19.48][Bridge]
[03:19.56]Who do I become tomorrow
[03:22.40]When tomorrow won’t sit still?
[03:25.08]I put both feet on the kitchen floor
[03:28.12]And let the noise pass through
[03:30.60]The kettle sings, the daylight comes
[03:36.32]My hands still know what to do
[03:42.68][Chorus]
[03:42.76]I’m still learning how to stay
[03:48.08]While the world rewrites its name
[03:53.72]Every door becomes a window
[03:56.72]Every fire becomes a flame
[03:59.52]If I’m late to every future
[04:02.40]Let me be late my own way
[04:05.64]I’m still learning how to stay
